      "result": "{\"log\":\"Gem3F Tinker turn 9 (6 - 5)\\nGLM47 Humble draws a card\\nGLM47 Humble attacks Gem3F Tinker with 5 creatures\\nGLM47 Humble - Ability triggers: Siege Striker - Whenever Siege Striker attacks, you may tap any number of untapped creatures you control. Siege Striker gets +1/+1 until end of turn for each creature tapped this way.\\nAttacker: Basri\\u0027s Lieutenant (7/8) blocked by Sage of the Falls (2/5) \\nAttacker: Trusty Retriever (4/5) blocked by Bloodline Pretender (3/3) \\nAttacker: Siege Striker (2/2) blocked by Amoeboid Changeling (1/1) \\nAttacker: Staunch Shieldmate (2/4) unblocked\\nAttacker: Tempered Veteran (2/3) unblocked\\n[Chat] Gem3F Tinker: That\\u0026#39;s a massive swing! It looks like I\\u0026#39;ll have to throw everything in the way just to stay alive. Your Lieutenant really is the star of the show here. Let\\u0026#39;s see if my chump blocks can buy me one more turn!\\nSiege Striker deals 2 damage to Amoeboid Changeling\\nAmoeboid Changeling died\\nSage of the Falls deals 2 damage to Basri\\u0027s Lieutenant\\nBasri\\u0027s Lieutenant deals 7 damage to Sage of the Falls\\nBloodline Pretender deals 3 damage to Trusty Retriever\\nTrusty Retriever deals 4 damage to Bloodline Pretender\\nGem3F Tinker loses 2 life at combat from Staunch Shieldmate\\nGem3F Tinker loses 2 life at combat from Tempered Veteran\\nBloodline Pretender died\\nSage of the Falls died\\nGLM47 Humble turn 9 (2 - 5)\\nGem3F Tinker draws a card\\nGem3F Tinker puts Island from hand onto the Battlefield\\nGem3F Tinker plays Island\\nGem3F Tinker casts Merrow Reejerey from hand\\n[Chat] GLM47 Humble: That was a brutal combat phase for you! \\u0026#128556; You\\u0026#39;re hanging on by a thread at 2 life. Merrow Reejerey could help stabilize your board... if you survive another turn.\\nGem3F Tinker puts Merrow Reejerey from stack onto the Battlefield\\nGem3F Tinker skip attack\\nGLM47 Humble casts Feat of Resistance targeting Staunch Shieldmate from hand\\nGLM47 Humble casts Feat of Resistance targeting Basri\\u0027s Lieutenant from hand\\n[Chat] Gem3F Tinker: Nice double Feat of Resistance! You\\u0026#39;re really locking this down. That Lieutenant is a absolute unit\\u0026mdash;I don\\u0026#39;t think my Merfolk can swim fast enough to get away from that! Things are looking pretty grim for me at 2 life.\\nFeat of Resistance: GLM47 Humble puts 1 +1/+1 counters on Basri\\u0027s Lieutenant\\nFeat of Resistance: GLM47 Humble has chosen protection from Blue\\nGLM47 Humble puts Feat of Resistance from stack into their graveyard\\nFeat of Resistance: GLM47 Humble puts 1 +1/+1 counters on Staunch Shieldmate\\nFeat of Resistance: GLM47 Humble has chosen protection from White\\nGLM47 Humble puts Feat of Resistance from stack into their graveyard\\nGem3F Tinker turn 10 (2 - 5)\\nGLM47 Humble draws a card\\nGLM47 Humble puts Plains from hand onto the Battlefield\\nGLM47 Humble plays Plains\\nGLM47 Humble attacks Gem3F Tinker with 1 creature\\nAttacker: Basri\\u0027s Lieutenant (8/9) blocked by Merrow Reejerey (2/2) \\nMerrow Reejerey deals 2 damage to Basri\\u0027s Lieutenant\\nBasri\\u0027s Lieutenant deals 8 damage to Merrow Reejerey\\nMerrow Reejerey died\\nGLM47 Humble turn 10 (2 - 5)\\nGem3F Tinker draws a card\\nGem3F Tinker casts River Sneak from hand\\nGem3F Tinker puts River Sneak from stack onto the Battlefield\\nGem3F Tinker skip attack\\nGem3F Tinker turn 11 (2 - 5)\\nGLM47 Humble draws a card\\nGLM47 Humble skip attack\\nGLM47 Humble casts Tempered Veteran from hand\\nGLM47 Humble puts Tempered Veteran from stack onto the Battlefield\\nGLM47 Humble turn 11 (2 - 5)\\nGem3F Tinker draws a card\\nGem3F Tinker puts Island from hand onto the Battlefield\\nGem3F Tinker plays Island\",\"total_length\":42056,\"truncated\":false,\"cursor\":42056,\"since_turn\":9,\"since_player\":\"Gem3F Tinker\"}",
