    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "With the opponent at 2 life, putting the +1/+1 counter on Staunch Shieldmate (a defensive creature) is suboptimal. Siege Striker with double strike would benefit far more from the counter, becoming a 3/3 double striker that can also tap creatures to grow when attacking, maximizing the ability to push through lethal damage.",
      "action_taken": "Put +1/+1 counter on Staunch Shieldmate",
      "better_line": "Put +1/+1 counter on Siege Striker, making it a 3/3 double striker that threatens 6+ damage and maximizes lethal potential against an opponent at 2 life",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 382,
      "player": "GLM47 Humble",
      "decision_index": 254,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Chose protection from white on Staunch Shieldmate when the opponent is mono-blue. Protection from blue would shield it from any potential blue instant-speed interaction for the remainder of the turn, while protection from white does literally nothing in this matchup.",
      "action_taken": "Chose White for Feat of Resistance's protection color",
      "better_line": "Choose Blue for Feat of Resistance's protection, as the opponent is playing blue and has untapped Islands that could cast blue instants in response or during the end step.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 395,
      "player": "GLM47 Humble",
      "decision_index": 265,
    },
    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "Opponent is at 2 life with no untapped creatures that can block (River Sneak is summoning sick). GLM47 has multiple large creatures including an 8/9 Basri's Lieutenant with vigilance. Any single attacker would deal lethal damage. This is a missed lethal.",
      "action_taken": "Declined to declare any attackers, passing the combat phase.",
      "better_line": "Attack with all creatures (or even just Basri's Lieutenant alone) to deal lethal damage to the opponent at 2 life with no blockers available.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 425,
      "player": "GLM47 Humble",
      "decision_index": 293,
    }
  ],
